- src/lib/calibration.ts: scorePredictions (Brier/hitRate/baseRate/byWeek/reliability,
  standard Brier=mean((p-y)^2) per card evidence) + joinPredictionsWithResets
  (Beijing-key reconciliation, first-row-per-day ex-ante, immature-day exclusion)
- scripts/calibrate.mjs: REVIEW artifact renderer (RUNBOOK 9.1 command verbatim),
  node >=22.18 native type-stripping loads lib directly (D016)
- lib import chain carries .ts extensions + tsconfig allowImportingTsExtensions;
  beijingCalendarDateKey exported from resetCard (single day-key source, D014-style)
- 16 domain tests incl. Brier anchors (perfect=0 / const-50%=0.25 / all-wrong=1),
  B06 anti-anchor join test, cross-year Monday weekKey; two mutation rounds red-verified
